<body>
    <h1>COLA Uplift Feature - Solution Design Overview=C2=A0</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong>COLA Uplift Feature - Solution Design Overview</strong>&=
nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Fortra | Salesforce Revenue Cloud</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p><em>Document Version: 2.0 | Date: December 2025&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Executive Summary</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>This document describes the solution design for implementing automated C=
ost of Living Adjustment (COLA) uplift functionality within Fortra's Salesf=
orce Revenue Cloud environment. The solution automatically applies annual p=
rice increases to renewal quotes based on predefined percentages by Solutio=
n Category, while providing sales representatives the flexibility to overri=
de these values when business needs require.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>1.1 Business Objectives</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Standardize annual renewal pricing increases across all product Solution=
 Categories<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Reduce manual pricing errors and ensure compliance with corporate pricin=
g policies<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Maintain complete audit trail of COLA applications and user overrides<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide flexibility for sales to adjust COLA percentages based on custom=
er negotiations&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p><strong>Solution Overview</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>The COLA Uplift solution leverages Salesforce Revenue Cloud's asset-base=
d ordering capabilities to automatically calculate and apply price increase=
s when renewal quotes are generated. The solution uses the current Asset pr=
ice as the base amount and applies a percentage increase based on the produ=
ct's Solution Category.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>2.1 Key Components</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"3=
d99671d-ab0c-44f5-9ec8-06e797b65301" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Component&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Purpose&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Custom Metadata Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Stores COLA percentages by Solution Category with effective dates&nbsp;<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>QuoteLineItem Fields&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Custom Fields (9)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Track COLA application, overrides, and audit information&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>QuoteLineItemTrigger&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apex Trigger&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Automatically applies COLA on quote line creation and handles overrides&=
nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLAUpliftHandler&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apex Class&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contains business logic for COLA calculation and field population&nbsp;<=
/p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>2.2 Solution Architecture</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The solution integrates with the existing Revenue Cloud data model throu=
gh the following relationships:&nbsp;</p>
<p><code>QuoteLineItem --&gt; QuoteAction --&gt; Asset --&gt; Product2 --&g=
t; ProductCategory (Solution Category)&nbsp;</code></p>
<p>When a renewal quote is created, the system traverses this relationship =
to determine the appropriate COLA percentage based on the product's Solutio=
n Category in the catalog hierarchy.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p><strong>Data Model</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>3.1 COLA Uplift Rules (Custom Metadata Type)</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt Custom Metadata Type stores the COLA percenta=
ge configurations. Using CMDT allows administrators to update COLA rates wi=
thout code deployments and provides version control through metadata deploy=
ments.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>CMDT Fields:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6=
a019b3a-bd99-495d-bce1-2b08a3fc4901" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Description&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Solution_Category__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text (100)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Matches ProductCategory.Name for Solution Category level&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default_Uplift_Percent__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number (5,2)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA percentage to apply (e.g., 7.85)&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Is_Active__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Checkbox&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enable/disable rule without deletion&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Effective_Start_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Rule effective from date&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Effective_End_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Rule effective until date (optional)&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Description__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text (255)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Administrative notes&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>3.2 COLA Rates by Solution Category</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b=
3477914-03b4-417a-8b40-b011407915f2" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Solution Category&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA %&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Robotic Process Automation&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>9.85%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Network Monitoring, GoAnywhere, Globalscape, Systems Management, Doc Man=
agement, Business Intelligence, Cybersecurity, Powertech IAM BoKS&nbsp;</p>=
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>7.85%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Vulnerability Management, Offensive Security&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>6.20%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email Security, Brand Protection, Human Risk Management, Cloud Data Prot=
ection, File Integrity Monitoring&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>5.00%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Data Protection, Core IGA, Capacity Management&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>4.70%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Fortra Platform (IPP)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>0%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default (No Match)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>0%&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>3.3 QuoteLineItem COLA Fields</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Nine custom fields are added to QuoteLineItem to track COLA application =
and provide audit capabilities:&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6=
bb3b276-3058-4902-b1d9-e15a75f67ef1" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Editable&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Purpose&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Uplift_Percent__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number (5,2)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Yes&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Applied COLA percentage - users can override&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default_COLA_Uplift_Percent__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number (5,2)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Original COLA % from rules - preserved for comparison&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pre_COLA_Price__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Currency&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Asset.Price stored for override recalculations&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Solution_Category__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text (100)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Solution Category used for COLA lookup&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Applied_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>DateTime&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>When COLA was first applied&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Modified_By__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lookup (User)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User who last modified COLA %&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Modified_Date__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>DateTime&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>When COLA % was last modified&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Override_Reason__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text (255)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Yes&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Justification for override&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Is_COLA_Overridden__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Formula&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>N/A&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TRUE if COLA % differs from Default&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ol start=3D"4">
<li>
<p><strong>Business Logic</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>4.1 COLA Application Process</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>When a renewal quote line is created, the system automatically:&nbsp;</p=
>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Identifies the quote line as a renewal by checking QuoteAction.Type =3D =
'Renew'<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Retrieves the current subscription price from Asset.Price<code>&nbsp;</c=
ode></p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigates the Product Catalog hierarchy to find the Solution Category<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Looks up the corresponding COLA percentage from COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Calculates the new price: UnitPrice =3D Asset.Price x (1 + COLA%/100)<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Populates all COLA tracking fields for audit purposes&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>4.2 Override Handling</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Sales representatives can override the COLA percentage when business nee=
ds require. When the COLA_Uplift_Percent__c field is modified:&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>The system recalculates: UnitPrice =3D Pre_COLA_Price__c x (1 + New COLA=
%/100)<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>COLA_Modified_By__c is set to the current user<code>&nbsp;</code></p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>COLA_Modified_Date__c is set to the current timestamp<code>&nbsp;</code>=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Is_COLA_Overridden__c formula evaluates to TRUE&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>The Pre_COLA_Price__c field preserves the original Asset.Price, ensuring=
 accurate recalculation regardless of how many times the COLA percentage is=
 adjusted.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"5">
<li>
<p><strong>User Experience</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>5.1 Quote Line Item Layout</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>A new 'COLA Information' section will be added to the QuoteLineItem page=
 layout, displaying:&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>COLA Uplift % (editable) - The applied percentage, modifiable by sales<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Default COLA Uplift % (read-only) - Original percentage from rules<code>=
&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>COLA Solution Category (read-only) - Category used for lookup<code>&nbsp=
;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Is COLA Overridden (formula) - Visual indicator when override applied<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>COLA Override Reason (editable) - Required justification for overrides<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit fields (read-only) - Applied Date, Modified By, Modified Date&nbsp=
;</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"6">
<li>
<p><strong>Testing Approach</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p>The solution will be validated through the following test scenarios:&nbs=
p;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d=
32f62fd-8045-4e71-9197-49fd95211c5e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Test Case&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Description&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-001&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Renewal quote line receives correct COLA % based on Solution Category&nb=
sp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-002&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Non-renewal quote lines do not receive COLA application&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-003&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Products without matching Solution Category default to 0% COLA&nbsp;</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-004&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Override tracking captures user and timestamp correctly&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-005&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
