</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-006&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Bulk renewal processing handles multiple quote lines efficiently&nbsp;</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>TC-007&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Inactive COLA rules are excluded from processing&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"8">
<li>
<p><strong>Assumptions and Dependencies</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Product Catalog hierarchy includes Solution Category level (Unit &gt; So=
lution Group &gt; Solution Category &gt; Solution Name)<code>&nbsp;</code><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>Asset records are properly created when orders are activated<code>&nbsp;=
</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>QuoteAction records link correctly to source Assets for renewal transact=
ions<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Sales users have appropriate permissions to edit COLA fields&nbsp;</p></=
li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"9">
<li>
<p><strong>Appendix: Calculation Examples</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Example 1: Standard COLA Application</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Product: GoAnywhere MFT (Solution Category: GoAnywhere)<code>&nbsp;</cod=
e><br>
Asset.Price: $10,000<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
COLA Rate: 7.85%<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Calculation: $10,000 x (1 + 0.0785) =3D $10,785<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Result: QuoteLineItem.UnitPrice =3D $10,785&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Example 2: COLA Override</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Product: GoAnywhere MFT (Solution Category: GoAnywhere)<code>&nbsp;</cod=
e><br>
Pre_COLA_Price__c: $10,000 (preserved from initial application)<code>&nbsp;=
</code><br>
Original COLA: 7.85% -&gt; UnitPrice =3D $10,785<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
User Override: COLA changed to 5.00%<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Recalculation: $10,000 x (1 + 0.05) =3D $10,500<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Result: QuoteLineItem.UnitPrice =3D $10,500, Is_COLA_Overridden__c =3D TRUE=
&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>10. Enhancement: Contract-Level COLA Override</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This enhancement extends the COLA Uplift solution to support Contract-le=
vel COLA overrides that persist across multiple renewal cycles. This enable=
s negotiated pricing adjustments to be honored automatically without manual=
 intervention on each renewal quote.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>10.1 Three-Tier Override Hierarchy</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The COLA percentage is now determined using a three-tier override hierar=
chy (highest to lowest priority):&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a=
1b8a72c-c6ce-44e9-933c-989bc5de4b71" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Priority&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Source&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Condition&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Source__c&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tier 1 (Highest)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Line Override&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User manually edits COLA_Uplift_Percent__c on QuoteLineItem&nbsp;</p></t=
d>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Line Override&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tier 2&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contract Override&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contract.COLA_Override_Percent__c has value AND persist date is valid&nb=
sp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contract Override&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tier 3 (Default)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>CMDT Lookup&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default from COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt by Solution Category&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>CMDT Lookup&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>10.2 Additional Data Model</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Contract Custom Fields:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2=
3968818-a14a-4645-89eb-ef7ef7a285e0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Editable&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Purpose&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Override_Percent__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number (5,2)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Yes&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional COLA override percentage for all Assets under this Contract&nbs=
p;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Override_Persist_Until__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Yes&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date until which override applies. Null =3D one-time use for next renewa=
l only&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Additional QuoteLineItem Field:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a=
a86c9bd-245f-4bef-a39c-8811506b2e28" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Field Name&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Type&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Editable&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Purpose&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Source__c&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Picklist&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>No&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tracks which tier of the override hierarchy provided the COLA percentage=
. Values: CMDT Lookup, Contract Override, Line Override&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>10.3 Updated Business Logic</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>When a renewal quote line is created, the system now follows an updated =
process:<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Identifies the quote line as a renewal by checking QuoteAction.Type =3D =
'Renew'<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Retrieves the current subscription price from Asset.Price<code>&nbsp;</c=
ode></p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigates the Product Catalog hierarchy to find the Solution Category<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>NEW: Queries AssetContractRelationship to find the active Contract for t=
he Asset<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>NEW: If Contract has COLA_Override_Percent__c set AND persist date is va=
lid (null or future):<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Uses Contract override percentage<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Sets COLA_Source__c =3D 'Contract Override'<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"6">
<li>
<p>If no valid Contract override, looks up COLA percentage from COLA_Uplift=
_Rules__mdt:<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Sets COLA_Source__c =3D 'CMDT Lookup'<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"7">
<li>
<p>Calculates the new price: UnitPrice =3D Asset.Price x (1 + COLA%/100)<co=
de>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Populates all COLA tracking fields for audit purposes&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p><strong>10.4 Contract Override Persist Date Logic</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"9=
a959bd9-7945-4c77-88ce-7cec832bb482" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>COLA_Override_Persist_Until__c Value&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Behavior&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Null/Empty&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>One-time use - Contract override applies to next renewal only&nbsp;</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Future Date (&gt;=3D today)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Multi-renewal - Contract override applies to all renewals until that dat=
e&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Past Date (&lt; today)&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Expired - Contract override is ignored, falls back to CMDT lookup&nbsp;<=
/p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>10.5 Calculation Examples with Contract Override</strong>&nbsp;<=
/p>
<p>Example 3: Contract Override (Multi-Renewal)<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code=
>&nbsp;</code><br>
Product: GoAnywhere MFT (Solution Category: GoAnywhere, CMDT COLA: 7.85%)<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code><br>
Contract: COLA_Override_Percent__c =3D 5.00%, COLA_Override_Persist_Until__=
c =3D 2027-12-31<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Asset.Price: $10,000<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Calculation: $10,000 x (1 + 0.05) =3D $10,500<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Result: QuoteLineItem.UnitPrice =3D $10,500, COLA_Source__c =3D 'Contract O=
verride'<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Example 4: Contract Override (One-Time Use)<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nb=
sp;</code><br>
Product: GoAnywhere MFT (Solution Category: GoAnywhere, CMDT COLA: 7.85%)<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code><br>
Contract: COLA_Override_Percent__c =3D 3.00%, COLA_Override_Persist_Until__=
c =3D null<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Asset.Price: $10,000<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Calculation: $10,000 x (1 + 0.03) =3D $10,300<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Result: QuoteLineItem.UnitPrice =3D $10,300, COLA_Source__c =3D 'Contract O=
verride'<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Note: Override applies to this renewal only; future renewals will use CMDT =
lookup<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Example 5: Expired Contract Override Falls Back to CMDT<code>&nbsp;</code><=
br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Product: GoAnywhere MFT (Solution Category: GoAnywhere, CMDT COLA: 7.85%)<c=
ode>&nbsp;</code><br>
Contract: COLA_Override_Percent__c =3D 3.00%, COLA_Override_Persist_Until__=
c =3D 2024-12-31 (past date)<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Asset.Price: $10,000<code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Calculation: $10,000 x (1 + 0.0785) =3D $10,785 (uses CMDT percentage)<code=
>&nbsp;</code><br>
Result: QuoteLineItem.UnitPrice =3D $10,785, COLA_Source__c =3D 'CMDT Looku=
p'&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>10.6 Updated Solution Architecture</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The solution now integrates with the Revenue Cloud data model through an=
 extended relationship path:<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
QuoteLineItem --&gt; QuoteAction --&gt; Asset --&gt; AssetContractRelations=
hip --&gt; Contract<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Key relationships:<code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Asset connects to Contract via the AssetContractRelationship junction ob=
ject (Revenue Cloud standard)<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Only Contracts with Status =3D 'Activated' are considered for COLA overr=
ides<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Multiple Assets can share the same Contract override<code>&nbsp;</code><=
/p></li>
</ul>
<p><br><code>&nbsp;</code><br>
Updated Components:<code>&nbsp;</code><br><code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Contract Custom Fields:<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>COLA_Override_Percent__c (Number 5,2)<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>COLA_Override_Persist_Until__c (Date)<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p><br><code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>QuoteLineItem Custom Field:<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>COLA_Source__c (Picklist: CMDT Lookup, Contract Override, Line Override)=
<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p><br><code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>COLAUpliftHandler.cls:<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Added getContractOverrides() method using dynamic SOQL<code>&nbsp;</code=
></p></li>
<li>
<p>Uses AssetContractRelationship to traverse from Asset to Contract<code>&=
nbsp;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Validates persist date logic before applying Contract override<code>&nbs=
p;</code></p></li>
</ul>
<p><br><code>&nbsp;</code></p>
<ol start=3D"4">
<li>
<p>COLA_Admin Permission Set:<code>&nbsp;</code></p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Added read/edit access to Contract COLA override fields<code>&nbsp;</cod=
e></p></li>
<li>
<p>Added read access to QuoteLineItem.COLA_Source__c&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
